### File nay dung voi extension "REST Client" trong VS Code
### de test nhanh tung request bang cach bam "Send Request" phia tren moi khoi.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@email = demo@example.com
@password = matkhaudungB123

### 1. Dang ky tai khoan moi
POST {{baseUrl}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 2. Dang ky lai cung email -> mong doi 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 3. Dang nhap dung -> nhan token
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 4. Dang nhap sai mat khau -> 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "sai-mat-khau"
}

### 5. Xem thong tin tai khoan (thay {{token}} bang token o buoc 3)
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Xem san pham theo trang thai
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?status=con_hang
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Status khong hop le -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?status=khong_ton_tai
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
